  "notes": "Government-wide Totals column used for balance sheet (p1). Governmental receipts/disbursements from Total Governmental Funds column (p4); transfers between General and Street (19,715) net to zero in total column so transfers fields are null. Business-type from proprietary statement p6: no single total printed so totals computed (operating + nonoperating). ending_cash computed from governmental funds balance sheet (cash line shows '-'). Beginning cash not shown. p8 budget schedule is all funds (mixes governmental and utility functions); budgetary basis totals differ from fund statements; it is the only detail schedule. All-funds lines are tagged by fund type: Water/Wastewater/RV Park lines business-type (department names the fund, fund = 'All funds' so the schedule totals tie); Charges for services, Interest and Debt service principal/interest split into governmental (p4) and business-type (p6/p7) shares (computed, split_from; budget not split); Taxes and Intergovernmental equal the governmental amounts; Other 41,412 kept governmental (only 31,370 traceable). Read pages 1-8 of 8. Detail (user 2026-10-27): per-fund lines from the fund statements' columns (p4, p6) replace the combined schedule."
